Package: spatialss
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Analysis for Social Sciences - Book Companion
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chong", "Chen", email = "cc458@tsinghua.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0000-0000")))
Description: Companion R package for the textbook "社会科学的空间分析"
    (Spatial Analysis for Social Sciences). Provides all datasets and
    utility functions needed to reproduce the analyses and examples
    presented in the book. The package includes spatial data (vector
    and raster), socioeconomic indicators, and helper functions for
    loading and accessing book datasets.
